Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: Fila
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Root file manager for @FLAVOR@ bootstraps
 Browse and edit every file on your device, not just the ones an app is allowed
 to see. Copy, move and rename with progress you can cancel, create and unpack
 zip, 7z, rar and tar archives, edit text with syntax highlighting, read plists,
 preview images and video, open a terminal, and share a folder to your computer
 over WebDAV. Deleted files go to a trash you can restore from, and the files
 your device needs in order to boot cannot be deleted by mistake.
